msgbox	MAXIE: There has to be some reason why GROUDON fled…That's what you're trying to say, aren't you?… … … … … … … … … … … …Humph… You think I didn't know that?With GROUDON gone, there is no longer any need for this blasted volcano.I am going after GROUDON, so this is where we part!
